			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> Dabbled with it, decided no. Many many many years ago. It exists for me purely as a single thing - a \"our CraftCMS build needed Nesting in CSS and we didn't want to use SCSS via CodeKit anymore...\" but I've not looked at that in years and it does nothing else. Can't wait to rip it out entirely for pure CSS soon :) <span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://social.tchncs.de/@mandrasch\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>mandrasch</span></a></span></p>",
