				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.masto.host/fediversezachleatcom/cache/accounts/avatars/109/543/551/045/998/536/original/e10f042a7b2e4a2e.jpg"
			},
			"date": "2026-04-17T16:01:15.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> a complete and total disregard for security is sort of inherent in using basically any of these LLM tools running in trusted contexts (on your computer, in your browser)</p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
		{
			"id": "116420889295250820",
			"parentId": "116420812147606730",
			"url": "https://front-end.social/@amber/116420889248418841",
			"author": {
				"name": "Amber Weinberg",
				"url": "https://front-end.social/@amber",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.masto.host/fediversezachleatcom/cache/accounts/avatars/109/366/278/963/792/488/original/5a31eb28a53bea08.png"
			},
			"date": "2026-04-17T16:03:11.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://mstdn.social/@mattwilcox\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>mattwilcox</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://social.tchncs.de/@mandrasch\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>mandrasch</span></a></span> just use Nova as my IDE, WordPress as my CMS, push and deploy via Git. Code in plain HTML/CSS/PHP. </p><p>KISS has never led me wrong in 20+ years!</p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
		{
			"id": "116420906593927251",
			"parentId": "116420881731039597",
			"url": "https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat/116420906593927251",
			"author": {
				"name": "Zach Leatherman",
				"url": "https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.masto.host/fediversezachleatcom/accounts/avatars/109/286/461/031/266/152/original/dc489c3746a44e00.png"
			},
			"date": "2026-04-17T16:07:36.182Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://mastodon.social/@cbirdsong\" class=\"u-url mention\">@<span>cbirdsong</span></a></span> I’ve experimented with a few things but in a sandboxed non-administrator user account with a fresh browser install and no active or secure browser sessions</p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
		{
			"id": "116421081651922386",
			"parentId": "116420889295250820",
			"url": "https://mstdn.social/@mattwilcox/116421081587757720",
			"author": {
				"name": "Matt Wilcox",
				"url": "https://mstdn.social/@mattwilcox",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.masto.host/fediversezachleatcom/cache/accounts/avatars/109/287/949/593/182/322/original/ea34d8a24964f103.png"
			},
			"date": "2026-04-17T16:52:06.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://front-end.social/@amber\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>amber</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://social.tchncs.de/@mandrasch\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>mandrasch</span></a></span> 100%</p><p>I am so happy I never went with any of the fashions of the time. No coffee script. No type script. No Vite. No node/bun/whatever new thing “saving us” from the problem with the last “it saves us!” tech.</p><p>Here I am, still making great sites that perform better than most others out there; and I haven’t had to “have a toolchain” or “rework my tooling” or “audit my dependencies for malware” or “migrate deployment providers” once.</p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
