			"date": "2026-04-17T17:07:18.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://mstdn.social/@mattwilcox\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>mattwilcox</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://social.tchncs.de/@mandrasch\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>mandrasch</span></a></span> the rough part seems to be though is finding work that also values this. I’ve been looking for months now, and everybody wants react or typescript.</p>",
